### 9. Delete a Quiz (Success)
# Replace REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID with an _id from request 1's response
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{quizLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###

### 10. Delete Quiz (404 — Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{quizLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

